*PCB*        GENERAL PARAMETERS OF THE PCB DESIGN

UNITS        1              2=Inches 1=Metric 0=Mils
USERGRID     37500  37500   Space between USER grid points
MAXIMUMLAYER 6              Maximum routing layer 
WORKLEVEL    3              Level items will be created on
DISPLAYLEVEL 1              toggle for displaying working level last
LAYERPAIR    1      2       Layer pair used to route connection
VIAMODE      P              Type of via to use when routing between layers
LINEWIDTH    150000         Width items will be created with
TEXTSIZE     2250000 225000  Height and LineWidth text will be created with
JOBTIME      18479          Amount of time spent on this PCB design
DOTGRID      150000 150000  Space between graphic dots
SCALE        2.713          Scale of window expansion
ORIGIN       385725000 341475000  User defined origin location
WINDOWCENTER 578854257 422705105  Point defining the center of the window
BACKUPTIME   20             Number of minutes between database backups
REAL WIDTH   75000          Widths greater then this are displayed real size
ALLSIGONOFF  1              All signal nets displayed on/off
REFNAMESIZE  2250000 225000  Height and LineWidth used by part ref. names
HIGHLIGHT    0              Highlight nets flag
JOBNAME      HWPT011B8_2022-08-16.pcb
CONCOL 1
FBGCOL 1 0
HATCHGRID    150000         Copper plane hatching grid
TEARDROP     2713690        Teardrop tracks
THERLINEWID  300000         Copper plane thermal line width
PSVIAGRID    37500  37500   Push & Shove Via Grid
PADFILLWID   381000         CAM finger pad fill width
THERSMDWID   300000         Copper plane thermal line width for SMD
MINHATAREA   0              Minimum hatch area
HATCHMODE    0              Hatch generation mode
HATCHDISP    1              Hatch display flag
DRILLHOLE    228600         Drill hole checking spacing
MITRERADII   0.5 1.0 1.5 2.0 2.5 3.0 3.5
MITRETYPE    2              Mitring type
HATCHRAD     0.500000       Hatch outline smoothing radius
MITREANG     180 180 180 180 180 180 90 
HATCHANG     0              Hatch angle
THERFLAGS    5121           Copper plane thermal line flags
DRLOVERSIZE  0              Drill oversize for plated holes
PLANERAD     0.500000       Plane outline smoothing radius
PLANEFLAGS   OUTLINE ALL Y Y Y N N Y Y Y N N Y N N Y Y N N N   Plane and Test Points flags
COMPHEIGHT   0              Board Top Component Height Restriction
KPTHATCHGRID 750000         Copper plane hatching grid
BOTCMPHEIGHT 0              Board Bottom Component Height Restriction
FANOUTGRID   75000  75000   Fanout grid
FANOUTLENGTH 9525000        Maximum fanout length
ROUTERFLAGS  83879441       Autorouter specific flags
